## Integration rules

- REST V2 uses form fields; DVS uses POST JSON with user and user_access_token.
- Discover organization-specific project, user and dropdown IDs before writing DVS tasks.
- MCP provides public documentation and authenticated file tools. Enabled storage writes require authorization; DVS tasks use REST.
- Use the protocol-specific authentication in each reference; never include credentials in URLs.
